Climbing, Jumping</li> </ul></li> <li>Pulling Blow, Pommel, Flat, Hilt</li> <li>Reload (1 or more instant)</li> <li>Stealth</li> <li>Take Down (Grappling Merit)</li> </ul><br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Reflexive Actions</b><ul><li>Delay Action (your turn)</li> <li>Drop Item (your turn)</li> <li>Perception</li> <li>Quick Draw (Physical Merit)</li> <li>Use Vitae, Essence</li> <li>Use Willpower (1 per instance max)<ul><li>Bolster Action/Contest (+3d)</li> <li>Bolster Resistance (+2)</li> </ul></li> </ul><b>Defense &amp; Dodge</b><ul><li>Defense (Lowest of Wits or Dex + Athletics)</li> <li>Block (Defensive Combat Brawl)</li> <li>Parry (Defensive Combat Weaponry)</li> <li>Shield (Cover bonus even vs firearms)</li> <li>Celerity (Even vs firearms)</li> <li>Dodge (Instant \u2013 loose action, x2 Defense)</li> <li>Cast Counterspell (Instant \u2013 loose action)</li> <li>Cast Shield Spell (Instant \u2013 loose action)</li> <li>Drop Prone (Instant \u2013 loose action)</li> <li>Run for Cover (Merit Instant \u2013 loose action)</li> </ul><b>Grapple (Continue a grapple)</b><ul><li>Break Free (and gain an Instant Action)</li> <li>Control/Draw Weapon (Lethal)<ul><li>Damage with Melee Weapon</li> <li>Damage with Firearms (Penalty Size -1)</li> <li>Disarm</li> <li>Disarm with Turnabout (Merit)</li> </ul></li> <li>Damage with Brawl (Bashing)</li> <li>Damage with Hard Surfaces (Merit)</li> <li>Damage with Violent Vampire Bite (1L/s, 1V=1L)<ul><li>Feed (Drains 1V/s = lethal, check BP max)</li> </ul></li> <li>Drag Prone (Both)</li> <li>Hold in Place<ul><li>Choke Hold (Merit)</li> <li>Restrain/Immobilize (Tilt)<ul><li>Apply Cuffs/Manacles (Control + s&gt;Str)</li> </ul></li> </ul></li> <li>Joint Lock (Merit)<ul><li>Restrain/Immobilize (Tilt)<ul><li>Apply Cuffs/Manacles (Control + s&gt;Str)</li> </ul></li> </ul></li> <li>Take Cover (Human Shield)</li> </ul><br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Modifiers</b><ul><li>Armor Piercing (+1 to +3 damage vs armor, max armor rating)</li> <li>Conditions</li> <li>Concealment (Barley -1, Partial -2, Substantial -3)</li> <li>Cover (If weapon dmg &gt; dur, subtract dur from dmg)</li> <li>Firing from Concealment (-0, -1, -2)</li> <li>Firing with Close Combat (Defense gained, penalty to stealth)</li> <li>Frenzy (Vampire) (+BP, No WP?)</li> <li>Human Shield (Breaking point)</li> <li>Immobilized with Bindings (No MV. No Def, No Actions)</li> <li>Immobilized with Grapple</li> <li>Improvised Weapon (-1 Attack)</li> <li>Mounted Enemy</li> <li>Offhand Attack (-2 Attack)</li> <li>Prone Attacker (-2 Attack)</li> <li>Prone Target (+2 Close, -2 Medium and beyond)</li> <li>Range (0, -1, -2, chance die)</li> <li>Rushing (-2, reduce time one step)</li> <li>Shooting at Targets in Close Combat (-2, -4 grapple)</li> <li>Specific Target<ul><li>Arm (-2)</li> <li>Ears (-4)</li> <li>Eye with Sand (-3)</li> <li>Eye with Weapon1 (-5)</li> <li>Hand (-4)</li> <li>Head (-3)</li> <li>Heart (-3, 5s)</li> <li>Leg (-2) (dmg&gt;sta, -2 Def &amp; Phy, both = prone)</li> </ul></li> <li>Surprised Target (No Def, no Instant)</li> <li>Stunned \u2013 Body (Dmg &gt; Size, No Action, \u00bd Def)</li> <li>Stunned \u2013 Head (Dmg &gt; Size-1, No Action, \u00bd Def)</li> <li>Wound Penalties (-1, -2, -3)</li> </ul>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"> <hr /><b><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Roleplaying</span> not <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Rollplaying</span> or <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Ruleplaying</span></span></b></div> <span style=\"font-family:arial\"><u><b>Current</b> <b>Focus</b></u><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Storypath &amp; Storypath to Run CoD, VtR, WtF, MtA</span></b><br /> <span style=\"color:#008000\"><b>Dungeons &amp; Dragons 5th Edition</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25095-graylion","name":"Graylion","avatar":"https://forum